            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Web sayfan şekillenmeye başlıyor.</p><p>Aşağıdaki kod parçacıklarından bazılarını kullanarak başka bir düğme oluştur. Ardından sonucu görmek için aşağıdaki düğmeye tıkla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Hello, World!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome to my website.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My projects\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Contact me\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/h1&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>, ardından <code>Contact me</code> ve son olarak <code>&lt;/button&gt;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
